            <ArticleTitle>Use of big data by Blue Cross and Blue Shield of North Carolina.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>195-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The health care industry is grappling with the challenges of working with and analyzing large, complex, diverse data sets. Blue Cross and Blue Shield of North Carolina provides several promising examples of how big data can be used to reduce the cost of care, to predict and manage health risks, and to improve clinical outcomes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
